{
 "n": 9,
 "title": "Why bunching receivers together beats man coverage",
 "html": "<p><strong>What a bunch is:</strong> three receivers lined up in a tight triangle, a yard or two apart, instead of spread across the field.</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 226\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A bunch formation against man coverage: two receivers cross paths right after the snap, and the defenders chasing them have to run through each other\"><defs><marker id=\"m27w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m27y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"150\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><path d=\"M290 178 L340 152 L392 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m27w)\"/><path d=\"M310 176 L282 146 L214 104\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m27w)\"/><path d=\"M300 152 L300 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m27w)\"/><path d=\"M272 132 L318 144 L384 146\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m27y)\"/><path d=\"M332 136 L292 140 L226 110\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m27y)\"/><path d=\"M298 134 l10 10 m0 -10 l-10 10\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"81.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"106.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"131.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"156.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"181.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"205\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"208.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"186\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"189.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"318\" cy=\"186\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"189.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><text x=\"360\" y=\"212\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">the bunch</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"118\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"121.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><circle cx=\"262\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"262\" y=\"131.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">NB</text><circle cx=\"342\" cy=\"130\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"133.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"36\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">White arrows: receivers’ routes</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"50\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Yellow dashes: man defenders chasing them</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"64\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">X: where the chasers run into each other</text></svg></div>\n<p><strong>Why it works against man:</strong> in man coverage, each defender must follow his receiver wherever he goes. When receivers start that close together and run crossing routes, the defenders chasing them have to run through the same small space. They bump into each other or get stuck behind a receiver who crossed in front of them, and their man gets a step of separation. That's called a \"rub\" or \"pick.\"</p>\n<p><strong>It's legal, within limits:</strong> a receiver can run a route that makes a defender go around him. He can't deliberately block the defender before the ball is thrown; that's offensive pass interference.</p>\n<p><strong>It also blocks the \"press\":</strong> in man coverage, cornerbacks like to line up right on top of a receiver and jam him at the line. With three receivers stacked tightly, the defenders can't all get a clean jam without running into one another.</p>\n<p><strong>Why it's less effective against zone:</strong> zone defenders don't chase anyone. They stay in their areas and take whoever arrives, so crossing routes just get handed from one defender to the next (Lesson 8). Defenses also answer bunches with a \"switch\" call: instead of chasing through traffic, two defenders swap receivers when the routes cross.</p>\n<div class=\"diagram\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 226\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The same bunch routes against zone: defenders stay on their side and take whichever receiver comes to them\"><defs><marker id=\"m28w\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/></marker><marker id=\"m28y\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"400\" y1=\"150\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"145\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.75)\">line of scrimmage</text><rect x=\"81.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"106.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"131.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"156.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><rect x=\"181.0\" y=\"153.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><circle cx=\"140\" cy=\"205\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"208.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">QB</text><path d=\"M290 178 L340 152 L392 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m28w)\"/><path d=\"M310 176 L282 146 L214 104\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m28w)\"/><path d=\"M300 152 L300 40\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#m28w)\"/><path d=\"M262 124 L238 112\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m28y)\"/><path d=\"M342 126 L366 132\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F2B705\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\" marker-end=\"url(#m28y)\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"164\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"167.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"186\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"189.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"318\" cy=\"186\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"189.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1F4D31\">WR</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"110\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"113.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">S</text><circle cx=\"262\" cy=\"128\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"262\" y=\"131.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">NB</text><circle cx=\"342\" cy=\"130\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#F2B705\"/><text x=\"342\" y=\"133.5\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14202B\">CB</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Against zone (or a \"switch\" call), defenders</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"54\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">stay on their side and take whoever comes.</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"68\" font-family=\"Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,.9)\">Nobody chases through the traffic.</text></svg></div>\n<p><strong>How to spot it on TV:</strong> look for three receivers clustered near one sideline. On third down near the goal line, where teams play a lot of man, it's often the play call.</p>",
